New in 0.13.0
• Share a place from Google Maps: tap Share, choose SportRecorder, and a new record opens with the place already filled in — name and position straight from Maps, nothing to type.
• If a place you already have sits somewhere else on the map, the app asks before updating it, and tells you how many past records would move.
• If a link can't be read, you can still save the meal and choose the place yourself.
